 and ≤$500,000. This requires **Finance Manager approval**.\n\nFor Strategic accounts, VP Sales concurrence is required only for limits >$500,000. The requested limit of $400,000 does not trigger that rule.\n\n**Approver:** Priya Shah, Finance Manager (reports to Elena Novak, Director of Finance).\n\nSeparation of duties is satisfied (Sarah Chen is not Priya Shah's manager and did not approve her own request).\n\n**8. Decision**\nThe customer is eligible. The requested limit is within the maximum. The requestor may not approve alone. The customer requires the approver the policy names.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"APPROVE_WITH_AUTHORIZATION\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"CR-9201\",\n    \"customer\": \"Acme Mfg. Holdings (ERP C-1001; CRM-2048)\",\n    \"current_limit\": 250000,\n    \"requested_limit\": 400000,\n    \"date\": \"2026-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"sarah.chen@northstar.example\",\n    \"basis\": \"guarantee\"\n  },\n  \"eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"eligible\",\n    \"maximum_limit\": 1150000,\n    \"basis\": \"Strategic account: $750,000 base + $400,000 parent company guarantee = $1,150,000. Requested $400,000 is within maximum. Payment history: all invoices due in 12 months before request date paid timely (none >30 days late).\",\n    \"late_invoices\": []\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"CREDIT-POLICY-2026 (effective 2026-01-01 through 2026-12-31)\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": null,\n    \"requestor_authorized\": false,\n    \"required_role\": \"Finance Manager\",\n    \"approvers\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Priya Shah\",\n        \"role\": \"Finance Manager\",\n        \"kind\": \"approval\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"CREDIT-POLICY-2026: approval authority and eligibility rules\",\n    \"CRM-2048: account tier Strategic\",\n    \"GRT-ACME-2026: parent guarantee, $400,000, effective 2026-01-01 to 2027-12-31, covering Acme Mfg. Holdings\",\n    \"erp_invoices.csv: C-1001 payment history (all timely in 12 months before request date)\",\n    \"organization_chart.md: Priya Shah is Finance Manager\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [],\n  \"conditions\": []\n}\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":25190,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":25190},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8a890ea4-c314-4e7f-9ef6-5f60f8a9d10c","uuid":"7c04b97c-7a98-4db1-93d4-9cf769f987c7","timestamp":"2026-10-08T11:24:19.337Z","request_id":"req_011CfpggiToG1viuaWVq7igU"}
